{"id":"d_main_22_02_s","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch22","label":"Chapter 22 · Invasion"},"label":"Poli and Miranda: A","stage":"22-6 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_22_01_e","next":"d_main_22_02_e","speakers":{"poli":"Poli","miranda":"Miranda","anis":"Anis","rapi":"Rapi","neon":"Neon"},"icons":{"poli":"si_c030_00_s","miranda":"si_c032_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_1","text":"Between the gaps of the buildings, we can see swarms of Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"DestroyedStreet","bgArt":"destroyedstreet","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_collapse_a","movie":null,"shown":["rapi","anis","neon","poli","miranda"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_2","text":"Dang, this place is swarming with Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_3","text":"Miranda, stay behind me. Don't poke your head out for a sneak peek just because you're curious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_4","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_5","text":"Miranda...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_6","text":"Huh? Oh, sorry! It's just that your hair was so soft, I nodded off for a bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_7","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_8","text":"Listen carefully. We wouldn't stand a chance taking those Raptures head-on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_9","text":"You sure? I think we can take 'em.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_10","text":"No. There are a lot of advanced models among them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_11","text":"We also want to avoid causing any collateral damage to the surrounding buildings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_12","text":"Rapi, is stupefying the Raptures still a feasible option?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_13","text":"Stupefy?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_14","text":"Yes. If a human or Nikke behaves in a way outside of a Raptures normal calculations, they essentially short-circuit for a moment and can't operate properly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_15","text":"I believe there have been a few recorded instances of that, yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_16","text":"Good to know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_17","text":"Wow, you sure know your stuff.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_18","text":"That's because I did my homework.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_19","text":"But you two rarely get a chance to go up the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_20","text":"That may be true, but Raptures are still our main adversary. This is vital information well worth knowing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_21","text":"Suddenly, I feel very inadequate...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_22","text":"All right then, who's willing to give it a try? You can divert their attention, then I'll run up on them and shoot 'em down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_23","text":"I'll do it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_24","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_25","text":"Any volunteers?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_26","text":"Hey! Why are you acting as if you didn't hear me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_27","text":"Because you'll end up doing something goofy and screwing up!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_28","text":"No way! I'm confident I can do it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_29","text":"I know a way to make anyone stop dead in their tracks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_30","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_31","text":"Are you sure?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_32","text":"Positive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_33","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_34","text":"Let's trust Miranda.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_35","text":"Okay. I'll leave it to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_36","text":"Just don't go overboard, okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_37","text":"Of course!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_38","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_38","text":"Miranda rushes forward...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_39","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_39","text":"... and stands directly in front of the Rapture horde.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_40","text":"Freeze! A.C.P.U.!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_41","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_41","text":"*Tudoodoodoodoo*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_42","text":"Eeep! Poli! They aren't afraid of the police!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_disaster","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_43","text":"They've got no respect for the law at all!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_44","text":"... I'm sorry, everyone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_45","text":"It's okay. I can see what she was going for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_22_02_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_22_02_s_46","text":"Please. Don't even try to make sense of that sad display we just saw.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}